### 阶段 6：Tool UI 框架预留

**目标：** 实现 `ToolRenderer`，为 GitHub/Codex/MCP 预留接口

**变更：**
1. **`tool_renderer.js` 实现：**
   ```js
   class ToolRenderer {
     static render(data) {
       const { tool, status, message, details } = data;
       const div = document.createElement('div');
       div.className = 'timeline-tool';
       
       const icon = status === 'running' ? '⏳' : status === 'success' ? '✓' : '✗';
       const statusClass = `tool-${status}`;
       
       div.innerHTML = `
         <div class="tool-header ${statusClass}">
           <span class="tool-icon">${icon}</span>
           <span class="tool-name">${tool}</span>
           <span class="tool-message">${message}</span>
         </div>
         ${details ? `<div class="tool-details">${details.join('<br>')}</div>` : ''}
       `;
       
       return div;
     }
   }
   ```

2. **测试数据发送：**
   ```js
   // 测试 GitHub Reader
   eventBus.emit('ToolStarted', { tool: 'github', message: '正在读取 app/state.py' });
   setTimeout(() => {
     eventBus.emit('ToolFinished', { tool: 'github', status: 'success', message: '已读取' });
   }, 2000);
   ```

3. **`ChatView` 监听工具事件：**
   ```js
   eventBus.on('ToolStarted', ({ tool, message }) => {
     const item = createToolStatus(tool, 'running', message);
     this.appendItem(item);
   });
   
   eventBus.on('ToolFinished', ({ tool, status, message }) => {
     // 更新最后一个 tool item 的状态
     const lastItem = this.getLastToolItem(tool);
     if (lastItem) {
       lastItem.data.status = status;
       lastItem.data.message = message;
       this.updateItem(lastItem);
     }
   });
   ```

**影响文件：** `tool_renderer.js`、`chat_view.js`、`event_bus.js`

**验证方式：** 在 Console 手动发送 `eventBus.emit('ToolStarted', ...)` → 确认 Timeline 出现工具状态 UI → 发送 `ToolFinished` → 确认状态更新为 ✓

